---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Typing speed test';
const description =
  'Type for 60 seconds and get your words per minute, accuracy and a result card you can download or share. Free, no ads, nothing leaves your device.';
const summary = 'Type for 60 seconds, get your speed and a shareable result card.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={description} tool="typing-test">
  <article class="tool" id="tool">
    <header class="tool__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Typing</p>
      <h1 class="tool__title">{pageTitle}</h1>
      <p class="tool__lead">{summary}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="bench">
      <div class="bench__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="typing-stage">
        <!--
          五段内置短文（BR-005）：写在 HTML 里而不是 JS 里——词表零 JS 体积，
          且禁用 JS 时第一段仍然可见（AC-022）。JS 启动后整组隐藏，文本渲染进
          上面的打字区。
        -->
        <div class="typing-passages" id="typing-passages">
          <p class="typing-passage">
            The quickest way to get better at something is to pay attention while you do it. Every
            sentence you type is a small exercise in rhythm and control. Try to keep your eyes on
            the screen instead of the keyboard, and let your fingers find the letters on their own.
            Speed comes later; steady accuracy is what carries you through.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage">
            A good morning routine does not have to be long. Ten quiet minutes with a cup of coffee
            and a short list of plans can set the tone for the whole day. The goal is not to fill
            every hour with work. It is to begin with a clear head, one small step at a time, and
            let the rest follow.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage">
            Cities change slowly, then all at once. A shop closes, a park opens, a new line appears
            on the map, and one day you notice the street looks nothing like the one you remember.
            Most people miss the middle part of the story. They only see the beginning and the end,
            and they wonder where the years went. It pays to look around.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage">
            Learning to cook is mostly learning to read a recipe twice before you start. Get the pan
            warm, chop everything first, and keep the salt within reach. Small habits like these
            turn a stressful evening into a calm one. Nobody cooks well in a rush, and the food
            always knows when you hurried. A calm kitchen is a happy kitchen.
          </p>
          <p class="typing-passage">
            The library was quiet in the way that only rainy afternoons can be. Someone turned a
            page two tables away, the heating hummed against the window, and the light outside
            turned soft and grey. She wrote one sentence, crossed it out, then wrote it again,
            slightly better, and decided that this was enough progress for one day. Rain has that
            effect on people.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="typing-meta">
          <p class="typing-clock" id="typing-clock" role="timer">
            60
          </p>
          <p class="typing-hint">Seconds left</p>
          <!--
            测试控制按钮贴着打字区（CR-001 / AC-037）：Start / End early / Try again
            三态切换。不与产物按钮放一起——打字是最高频动作，控制它的按钮必须
            就在眼前，点完不用再找输入位置。
          -->
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-variant="primary" id="test-control">
            Start
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="typing-track-wrap">
          <label class="sr-only" for="typing-input">
            Type the text shown below
          </label>
          <div class="typing-track" id="typing-track" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <!--
            原位隐藏输入（2026-09-28 用户裁定，AC-020）：opacity 0 但保留尺寸与
            可聚焦性（不用 display:none，iOS 拒绝对其聚焦），字号 16px 防 iOS
            聚焦放大。点击文本区即点中它。
          -->
          <input
            class="typing-input"
            id="typing-input"
            type="text"
            autocomplete="off"
            autocapitalize="off"
            autocorrect="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            maxlength="400"
            disabled
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <output class="readout" id="readout" data-state="pending" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="readout__label">Your result</p>
        <p class="readout__value" id="readout-value" hidden></p>
        <p class="readout__note" id="readout-note">
          Press Start, then type the text above as carefully as you can.
        </p>
        <canvas class="typing-canvas" id="typing-canvas" hidden></canvas>
      </output>

      <div class="tool__actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-variant="primary" id="copy-link" disabled>
          Copy link
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="download-image" disabled>
          Download image
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tool__notes">
      <h2 class="tool__notes-title">How this works</h2>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Press Start and the 60-second timer begins right away. Type the text you see; wrong
        characters turn red and underlined but never stop you, and backspace works as usual. You can
        press End early once at least 15 seconds have passed — shorter runs are too small a sample
        to be worth a number.
      </p>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Your speed is counted the standard way: five characters make one word, backspaced characters
        do not count, and accuracy is the share of characters you got right. Nothing is saved
        anywhere — close the tab and the result is gone.
      </p>

      <h2 class="tool__notes-title">Sharing</h2>
      <p class="tool__notes-body">
        Download image saves a result card with a small PlainKit mark in the corner. Copy link puts
        your result into the link itself — anyone who opens it sees the same card, and nothing ever
        touches a server.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import {
    buildTargetBuffer,
    computeStats,
    decodeResult,
    diffTyping,
    encodeResult,
    formatResultLabels,
    needsMoreTarget,
    ratingFor,
    type TargetBuffer,
    type TypingStats,
  } from '@/lib/tools/typing-test';
  import { drawResultCard } from '@/lib/shared/canvas-card';

  /** 测试时长（BR-001）。 */
  const DURATION_MS = 60000;

  function init(): void {
    const view = {
      passages: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLParagraphElement>('.typing-passage')),
      passageGroup: document.querySelector('#typing-passages') as HTMLDivElement | null,
      track: document.querySelector('#typing-track') as HTMLDivElement | null,
      input: document.querySelector('#typing-input') as HTMLInputElement | null,
      clock: document.querySelector('#typing-clock') as HTMLParagraphElement | null,
      readout: document.querySelector('#readout') as HTMLOutputElement | null,
      readoutValue: document.querySelector('#readout-value') as HTMLParagraphElement | null,
      note: document.querySelector('#readout-note') as HTMLParagraphElement | null,
      canvas: document.querySelector('#typing-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement | null,
      control: document.querySelector('#test-control') as HTMLButtonElement | null,
      copyButton: document.querySelector('#copy-link') as HTMLButtonElement | null,
      downloadButton: document.querySelector('#download-image') as HTMLButtonElement | null,
    };
    if (
      !view.passageGroup ||
      !view.track ||
      !view.input ||
      !view.clock ||
      !view.readout ||
      !view.readoutValue ||
      !view.note ||
      !view.canvas ||
      !view.control ||
      !view.copyButton ||
      !view.downloadButton ||
      view.passages.length === 0
    ) {
      return;
    }

    // 段落来自本页 HTML；规范化空白，杜绝源码缩进混进文本（BR-005）。
    const passages = view.passages.map((element) =>
      (element.textContent ?? '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim(),
    );

    type Phase = 'idle' | 'running' | 'done' | 'shared';
    let phase: Phase = 'idle';
    let currentIndex = 0;
    let buffer: TargetBuffer | null = null;
    let spans: HTMLSpanElement[] = [];
    let startedAt = 0;
    let timerId = 0;
    let lastStats: TypingStats | null = null;

    function setClock(seconds: number): void {
      view.clock!.textContent = String(seconds);
    }

    /** 把 buffer 渲染成字符 span（无 JS 时该区为空，段落原样可见，AC-022）。 */
    function renderTrack(): void {
      if (!view.track || !buffer) return;
      const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();
      spans = [];
      for (const character of buffer.text) {
        const span = document.createElement('span');
        span.textContent = character;
        fragment.appendChild(span);
        spans.push(span);
      }
      view.track.replaceChildren(fragment);
      view.input!.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
    }

    /** 按 diff 刷新着色；光标 = 下一个待打位置。 */
    function paint(diff: { states: string[] }, typedLength: number): void {
      for (let i = 0; i < spans.length; i += 1) {
        const span = spans[i]!;
        const state = diff.states[i] ?? 'pending';
        span.classList.toggle('is-correct', state === 'correct');
        span.classList.toggle('is-wrong', state === 'wrong');
        span.classList.toggle('is-cursor', i === typedLength);
      }
    }

    function renderPending(message: string): void {
      view.readout!.setAttribute('data-state', 'pending');
      view.readoutValue!.hidden = true;
      view.canvas!.hidden = true;
      view.note!.hidden = false;
      view.note!.textContent = message;
      view.copyButton!.disabled = true;
      view.downloadButton!.disabled = true;
    }

    /** 预览与导出走同一个 drawResultCard（AC-011 / AC-012 / AC-029）。
     *  画布内部固定 1080×1080（卡片的设计坐标），CSS 负责缩放显示——
     *  drawResultCard 按 1080 布局，内部尺寸若跟随 CSS 宽度会把内容画到画布外
     *  （2026-09-28 浏览器验收实测踩坑）。 */
    function drawCardPreview(): void {
      if (!view.canvas || !lastStats) return;
      view.canvas.width = 1080;
      view.canvas.height = 1080;
      const ctx = view.canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) return;
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      drawResultCard(ctx, {
        wpm: String(lastStats.wpm),
        unitLabel: 'words per minute',
        detailLabel: labels.detail,
        rating: ratingFor(lastStats.wpm),
      });
    }

    function showResult(stats: TypingStats, textIndex: number): void {
      lastStats = stats;
      const labels = formatResultLabels(stats);
      view.readoutValue!.hidden = false;
      view.readoutValue!.textContent = labels.readout;
      view.note!.hidden = false;
      view.note!.textContent = labels.note;
      view.readout!.setAttribute('data-state', 'ok');
      view.canvas!.hidden = false;
      drawCardPreview();

      // 结果首次出现的 180ms 过渡（AC-031）；prefers-reduced-motion 全局兜底。
      view.readout!.classList.add('is-entering');
      window.requestAnimationFrame(() => view.readout!.classList.remove('is-entering'));

      view.copyButton!.disabled = false;
      view.downloadButton!.disabled = false;
      syncUrl({ textIndex, wpm: stats.wpm, accuracy: stats.accuracy, seconds: stats.seconds });
    }

    /** 把成绩写进地址栏（Copy link 的基础）；离开结果态时清掉。 */
    function syncUrl(
      result: { textIndex: number; wpm: number; accuracy: number; seconds: number } | null,
    ): void {
      const url = new URL(window.location.href);
      url.search = result ? encodeResult(result).toString() : '';
      window.history.replaceState(null, '', url);
    }

    function start(): void {
      phase = 'running';
      lastStats = null;
      syncUrl(null);
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(passages, currentIndex, 1);
      renderTrack();
      view.input!.value = '';
      view.input!.disabled = false;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      setClock(DURATION_MS / 1000);
      view.control!.textContent = 'End early';
      renderPending('The timer is running. Press Escape to end early.');
      // 点 Start（或按 Enter）后视口回到打字区，不让用户再手动找输入位置（AC-038）。
      // 默认 instant 滚动——DESIGN.md §6-bis.7 禁滚动动画。
      view.track!.scrollIntoView({ block: 'center' });
      // 焦点跟到输入框（CR-001 用户要求）：disabled 解除后必须显式 focus，
      // 否则焦点留在 Start 按钮上，按 Enter 会立刻触发 End early。
      view.input!.focus();
      startedAt = Date.now();
      timerId = window.setInterval(tick, 200);
    }

    // ── 快捷键（CR-001 / AC-037）：Enter = 开始/再来一次，Escape = 提前结束 ──
    // 焦点在按钮/链接上时不拦截，让原生激活生效（焦点在 Copy link 上按 Enter
    // 必须还是复制，不能被全局快捷键劫持）。
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (event: KeyboardEvent) => {
      if (event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || event.altKey || event.shiftKey) return;
      const target = event.target as HTMLElement | null;
      const onActivator =
        target !== null && (target.tagName === 'BUTTON' || target.tagName === 'A');
      if (
        event.key === 'Enter' &&
        !onActivator &&
        (phase === 'idle' || phase === 'shared' || phase === 'done')
      ) {
        event.preventDefault();
        view.control!.click();
      } else if (event.key === 'Escape' && phase === 'running') {
        event.preventDefault();
        finish();
      }
    });

    function tick(): void {
      const elapsed = Date.now() - startedAt;
      setClock(Math.max(0, Math.ceil((DURATION_MS - elapsed) / 1000)));
      if (elapsed >= DURATION_MS) finish();
    }

    /** typed 逼近 buffer 末尾时续接下一段（AC-018），计时不中断。 */
    function extendBufferIfNeeded(): void {
      if (!buffer || !needsMoreTarget(buffer.text.length, view.input!.value.length)) return;
      buffer = {
        text: buffer.text + passages[buffer.nextIndex]!,
        nextIndex: (buffer.nextIndex + 1) % passages.length,
      };
      renderTrack();
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, view.input!.value), view.input!.value.length);
    }

    function finish(): void {
      window.clearInterval(timerId);
      phase = 'done';
      view.input!.disabled = true;
      const elapsed = Math.min(Date.now() - startedAt, DURATION_MS);
      setClock(Math.ceil((DURATION_MS - elapsed) / 1000));
      view.control!.textContent = 'Try again';

      const stats = computeStats(buffer?.text ?? '', view.input!.value, elapsed);
      if (!stats.ok) {
        // 无效样本：不结算、不出卡（BR-004），只给一行说明怎么改。
        lastStats = null;
        renderPending(stats.message);
        syncUrl(null);
        return;
      }
      showResult(stats.value, currentIndex);
    }

    function resetToIdle(nextIndex: number): void {
      phase = 'idle';
      currentIndex = ((nextIndex % passages.length) + passages.length) % passages.length;
      lastStats = null;
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(passages, currentIndex, 1);
      renderTrack();
      view.input!.value = '';
      view.input!.disabled = true;
      view.input!.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      setClock(DURATION_MS / 1000);
      view.control!.textContent = 'Start';
      renderPending('Press Start or Enter, then type the text above as carefully as you can.');
      syncUrl(null);
    }

    // ── 三态控制按钮（AC-032：Start / End early / Try again，同一位置）──
    view.control!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (phase === 'idle' || phase === 'shared') start();
      else if (phase === 'running') finish();
      else resetToIdle(currentIndex + 1);
    });

    // ── 输入：字符串即状态，退格/粘贴交给浏览器（AC-004 / 005 / 017）──
    view.input!.addEventListener('input', () => {
      if (phase !== 'running' || !buffer) return;
      extendBufferIfNeeded();
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, view.input!.value), view.input!.value.length);
    });

    // ── Copy link（AC-012）──
    let copyResetTimer = 0;
    function resetCopyLabelLater(): void {
      window.clearTimeout(copyResetTimer);
      copyResetTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
        view.copyButton!.textContent = 'Copy link';
      }, 2000);
    }
    view.copyButton!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const write = navigator.clipboard?.writeText(window.location.href);
      if (!write) {
        view.copyButton!.textContent = 'Copying is not available in this browser';
        resetCopyLabelLater();
        return;
      }
      write
        .then(() => {
          view.copyButton!.textContent = 'Link copied';
        })
        .catch(() => {
          view.copyButton!.textContent = 'Copying was blocked — copy the address bar link instead';
        })
        .finally(resetCopyLabelLater);
    });

    // ── Download image（AC-011）：1080×1080 PNG，与预览同一个 drawResultCard ──
    view.downloadButton!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!lastStats) return;
      const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
      canvas.width = 1080;
      canvas.height = 1080;
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) {
        view.downloadButton!.textContent = 'Not available in this browser';
        return;
      }
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      drawResultCard(ctx, {
        wpm: String(lastStats.wpm),
        unitLabel: 'words per minute',
        detailLabel: labels.detail,
        rating: ratingFor(lastStats.wpm),
      });
      canvas.toBlob((blob) => {
        if (!blob) {
          view.downloadButton!.textContent = 'Export failed — try again';
          return;
        }
        const link = document.createElement('a');
        link.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        link.download = `typing-${lastStats?.wpm ?? 0}wpm.png`;
        link.click();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(link.href);
      }, 'image/png');
    });

    // ── 分享链接：合法参数 → 直接还原同一张卡（AC-012）──
    const shared = decodeResult(new URLSearchParams(window.location.search));
    if (shared) {
      phase = 'shared';
      currentIndex = shared.textIndex;
      buffer = buildTargetBuffer(passages, currentIndex, 1);
      view.passageGroup!.setAttribute('data-live', '');
      renderTrack();
      view.input!.maxLength = buffer.text.length;
      paint(diffTyping(buffer.text, ''), 0);
      lastStats = {
        wpm: shared.wpm,
        accuracy: shared.accuracy,
        correct: 0,
        typed: 0,
        seconds: shared.seconds,
      };
      const labels = formatResultLabels(lastStats);
      view.readoutValue!.hidden = false;
      view.readoutValue!.textContent = labels.readout;
      view.note!.hidden = false;
      view.note!.textContent = 'A shared result — press Try it yourself to try your own speed.';
      view.readout!.setAttribute('data-state', 'ok');
      view.canvas!.hidden = false;
      drawCardPreview();
      view.copyButton!.disabled = false;
      view.downloadButton!.disabled = false;
      view.control!.textContent = 'Try it yourself';
      setClock(DURATION_MS / 1000);
    } else {
      resetToIdle(0);
    }
    // JS 接管后隐藏原始段落容器（无 JS 时第一段可见，AC-022）。
    view.passageGroup!.setAttribute('data-live', '');
  }

  // 顶层保护：任何未预期的错误不得导致整页白屏（DESIGN.md §9.3）
  try {
    init();
  } catch {
    // 页面无 JS 时本来就完整可读（渐进增强），这里保持静默
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* 内置段落容器：无 JS 时显示第一段；JS 接管后整组隐藏 */
  .typing-passages[data-live] .typing-passage {
    display: none;
  }

  .typing-passages:not([data-live]) .typing-passage + .typing-passage {
    display: none;
  }

  .typing-passages:not([data-live]) .typing-passage:first-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .typing-stage {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .typing-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* 控制按钮贴着打字区（CR-001）：时钟在左，按钮推到行尾 */
  .typing-meta .btn {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* 倒计时：--text-xl，不是结果读数字号（AC-028，BR-007） */
  .typing-clock {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .typing-hint {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .typing-track-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* 打字区：普通英文句子，自然换行，不留粘贴框感 */
  .typing-track {
    min-height: 7.8em;
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.95;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* 字符 span 由 JS 运行时创建，不带 Astro 的 scoped 属性——必须 :global()，
     否则着色样式全部落空（2026-09-28 浏览器验收实测踩坑） */
  .typing-track :global(span) {
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .typing-track :global(span.is-correct) {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* 错误态双载体：红 + 下划线（DESIGN.md §6-bis.9 第 10 条，AC-004） */
  .typing-track :global(span.is-wrong) {
    color: var(--danger);
    background: var(--danger-wash);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .typing-track :global(span.is-cursor) {
    background: var(--accent-wash);
  }

  /* 原位隐藏输入：opacity 0、盖满打字区、保留可聚焦性；16px 防 iOS 放大（AC-020） */
  .typing-input {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: transparent;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    caret-color: transparent;
  }

  .typing-input:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  /* 结果卡预览：与导出同一个 drawResultCard，正方形（AC-012） */
  .typing-canvas {
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 340px);
    margin: var(--space-4) auto 0;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }

  /* 结果首次出现的 180ms 过渡（AC-031）；prefers-reduced-motion 全局兜底 */
  .readout {
    transition:
      opacity var(--dur-enter) var(--ease-out),
      transform var(--dur-enter) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .readout.is-entering {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(6px);
  }
</style>
